---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const ld = [{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/about/"}]}];
---
<Layout title="About DsignPoint | The founder behind the agency" description="Meet the founder of DsignPoint, a strategic growth partner for founders whose business has outgrown its brand." path="/about/" ogImage="/og/bn_about.jpg"   jsonld={ld}>


<div style="position:relative;overflow-x:hidden;">
<section style="position:relative;min-height:min(72vh,700px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);overflow:hidden;background:oklch(18% 0.04 20);"><img src="../uploads/bn_about.webp" alt="Woman looking out over a Mediterranean bay at golden hour, holding a coffee" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%;"><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.40) 0%, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.18) 40%, oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.92) 100%);"></div>
    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <a href=".." class="dp-logo" aria-label="DsignPoint home"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><img src="../uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" style="height:48px;width:auto;display:block;"><img src="../uploads/DP-wordmark-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="DsignPoint" style="height:24px;width:auto;display:block;"></span></a>
      <button type="button" class="dp-burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dp-nav"><span></span><span></span></button><div id="dp-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Main" class="dp-nav-links" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(14px,2vw,30px);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">
        <a href=".." style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Home</a>
        <a href="../approach/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Approach</a>
        <a href="../case-studies/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Case Studies</a>
        <a href="../insights/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Insights</a>
        <a href="./" style="color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">About</a>
        <a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);background:oklch(83% 0.05 80);color:oklch(24% 0.11 15);padding:12px 24px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 8px 28px oklch(83% 0.05 80 / 0.35);transition:background 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h1">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>


<div style="position:relative;z-index:2;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:clamp(72px,12vh,140px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px) clamp(32px,5vh,64px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 24px;">About DsignPoint</p><h1 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,68px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:20ch;">Your business has a vision. We make sure the world sees it.</h1><p style="font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,18px);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:52ch;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">The right next step for your business starts with understanding where you are, where you want to go, and what needs to change to get you there.</p><a href="../book-a-call/" style="align-self:flex-start;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h2">Let's talk about what's next <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
</section>
<section style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(72px,12vh,150px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 32px;">We start with the business</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,104px);line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:0;max-width:15ch;">We don’t start with your brand. We start with your business.</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(8px,4vw,64px);margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,72px);"><div style="flex:1 1 340px;"><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">A new website won't solve an unclear offer. A refreshed identity won't fix a positioning problem. And more marketing won't deliver meaningful growth if the foundations aren't working together.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">That's why we look beyond the immediate request. We take the time to understand your business, your ambitions, your audience and the challenges between where you are today and where you want to be.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 340px;"><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">Then we connect the dots: strategy, brand, digital experience and marketing, brought together with a clear purpose.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.3;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:0;">Because the goal isn't simply to look better online. It's to make your business easier to understand, trust and choose.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,80px);align-items:center;"><div style="flex:1 1 380px;max-width:520px;"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ab_agency.webp" alt="Two women walking and talking along a palm-lined seaside promenade" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 25%;"></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 400px;"><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:16ch;">More than an agency. A partner in your next chapter.</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">Since 2017, DsignPoint has worked with businesses across Europe to turn ideas, ambitions and opportunities into stronger digital experiences.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">Every business reaches moments when what used to work no longer feels enough. The offer has evolved. The audience has changed. The business is ready for a bigger stage, but the way it presents itself is still telling an old story.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">We help close that gap. We bring an outside perspective, strategic direction and the creative and technical capabilities to move things forward.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.3;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:12px 0 0;">Not a one-size-fits-all formula. Not a collection of disconnected deliverables. A considered partnership built around what your business actually needs next.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(24% 0.11 15);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(72px,11vh,140px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 28px;">How we think. How we work.</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);margin:0 0 16px;max-width:18ch;">Good work doesn’t begin with jumping into production.</h2><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 clamp(40px,6vw,72px);">It begins with asking better questions.</p><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:clamp(24px,2.6vw,40px);"><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,72px);line-height:1;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 18px;">01</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">Understand</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">We get to know your business: what you do, who you serve, what makes you valuable, what is working and what is getting in the way. We look at the bigger picture before recommending the next move.</p></div><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,72px);line-height:1;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 18px;">02</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">Find direction</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">We identify the priorities and shape a clear direction. That may mean refining your positioning, clarifying your offer, strengthening your brand, improving your digital experience or rethinking how your marketing works together.</p></div><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,72px);line-height:1;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 18px;">03</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">Build with purpose</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Strategy becomes tangible. We bring the right ideas to life through brand development, websites, content, digital marketing and tailored solutions — always connected to the objective, never just for the sake of delivering something.</p></div><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,72px);line-height:1;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 18px;">04</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">Keep evolving</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Businesses change. Markets move. Opportunities appear. We believe the best digital presence is not frozen in time; it grows alongside the business. We help you make thoughtful next moves as your needs evolve.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 24px;">What we bring</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 20px;max-width:18ch;">Strategy meets creativity. Ideas meet execution.</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 40px;max-width:56ch;">Our work connects the thinking behind your business with the experience people have of it. Depending on what you need, that can include:</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(12px,1.6vw,20px);"><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 0px;">01</p><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 14px;">Business & Growth Strategy</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);max-width:44ch;">Business and digital direction, positioning, offer clarity, customer journey thinking and growth priorities.</p></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 0px;">02</p><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 14px;">Brand & Positioning</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);max-width:44ch;">Brand strategy, identity, messaging and the foundations that make your business recognisable, relevant and trusted.</p></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 0px;">03</p><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 14px;">Digital Presence & Experience</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);max-width:44ch;">Website strategy and design, WordPress development, user experience, SEO foundations and conversion-focused improvements.</p></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 0px;">04</p><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 14px;">Marketing & Visibility</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);max-width:44ch;">Content strategy, social media, digital campaigns, search visibility and the systems that help the right people discover and choose you.</p></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 0px;">05</p><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 14px;">Digital Innovation & Solutions</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);max-width:44ch;">Practical digital tools, integrations, automation and tailored solutions that make the business work smarter.</p></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);min-height:260px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;"><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:0;">The mix is never predetermined. We focus on the capabilities that make sense for your goals, your stage and your resources.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);"><div style="flex:1 1 380px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 24px;">Fit</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:14ch;">We work best with businesses that think ahead.</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">You don't need to have everything figured out before you speak to us. But you do need to be open to looking at your business with fresh eyes.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">Whether you're building a stronger foundation or preparing for your next stage of growth, the work starts with understanding what matters most.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 400px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 24px;">We are a good fit for people who:</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">Know their business has more potential than its current online presence communicates.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">Want more than a quick visual fix or a disconnected marketing tactic.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">Value clear thinking, honest conversations and purposeful creative work.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">Are ready to make decisions that support sustainable progress.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/7;width:100%;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ab_band.webp" alt="Friends and colleagues laughing together at a long table in a Spanish courtyard at dusk" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%;"></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);"><div style="flex:1 1 380px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 24px;">Together</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:14ch;">A little more human. A lot more connected.</h2></div><div style="flex:1 1 420px;"><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">We believe good partnerships are built on more than deliverables. They're built on communication, trust, curiosity and a shared commitment to doing things properly.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">DsignPoint brings together strategic thinking, creative talent and digital expertise, working collaboratively with clients and trusted specialists to move projects forward. Distance has never been a barrier to meaningful collaboration: our work connects people, ideas and businesses across borders.</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 20px;">We communicate in English, French, Spanish and Portuguese, helping make collaboration feel clear and natural across different markets.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.3;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:12px 0 0;">We care about the details, but we never lose sight of the people and business behind them.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start;"><div style="flex:1 1 340px;max-width:460px;"><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(46px,5.4vw,72px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:0 0 28px;">The Founder</h2><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ab_founder.webp" alt="Cindy Mateus, founder of DsignPoint" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;"></div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,28px);line-height:1.3;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);margin:28px 0 0;">“Because when a business feels like someone, people stop being an audience and start becoming part of the story.”</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 440px;"><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.6;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 28px;">I help people with a story, a stubborn idea and a reason to start. This is how I started.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.7vw,22px);line-height:1.6;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">There is a certain paradox in humanizing what is digital. Yet I love paradoxes, and this is exactly what I do: I humanize businesses online.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.7vw,22px);line-height:1.6;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">Because what sells is the person behind the service, not the service itself. The way someone speaks, the confidence she shows, the resilience she carries: all of it is energy, perceived before it is understood, and it sells.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.7vw,22px);line-height:1.6;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 22px;">What comes from the heart is what people experience. People buy feelings, and I help business owners make their clients feel their services.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.7vw,22px);line-height:1.6;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 28px;">For almost ten years I’ve helped my clients sell feelings, not services. Each of them is a story I keep in my diary. They all thrive, and I couldn’t be prouder to witness their success every single day. Because their story is my story.</p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/signature.png" alt="Cindy Mateus signature" style="display:block;width:clamp(180px,18vw,240px);height:auto;margin:0 0 10px -6px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0;">Founder, DsignPoint</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="position:relative;min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);text-align:center;overflow:hidden;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/CTA-section-bg.webp" alt="Colleagues reviewing work together at a café table, backlit by evening light" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, oklch(30% 0.13 17 / 0.4), oklch(12% 0.07 18 / 0.88));"></div><div style="position:relative;max-width:820px;padding:clamp(56px,9vh,100px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,80px);margin:0 0 28px;">So, what’s next for your business?</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,19px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 auto 20px;max-width:52ch;color:oklch(90% 0.015 40);">Maybe your business has outgrown its current brand. Maybe your website no longer reflects the quality of what you do. Or maybe you know it’s time to bring everything together with a clearer direction.</p><p style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,19px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 auto 40px;max-width:46ch;color:oklch(90% 0.015 40);">Wherever you are starting from, let’s work out what the next step should be.</p><a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h3">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
